# Normalize to LF on checkout regardless of platform/core.autocrlf.
# Byte-exact fixtures (fixtures/expected/*) are pinned against LF file
# sizes; CRLF checkout on Windows silently inflates every text file by
# one byte per line and breaks those snapshots.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
